    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ife Abaisiraeli abasigairegho twenatwena tuli kitole: bakabona, n'Abalevi, n'abakuumi ab'emiryango, n'abembi, n'abagheereza ab'omu isinzizo, n'abo boonaboona abeeyawula ku bantu b'omu kiketezo kino ni bagonderanga Amateeka ga Katonda, nga bali ghalala ni bakazi baibwe, ni batabane baibwe, ni baghala baibwe, boonaboona abalimu amagezi n'okutegeera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tweyimba ku baganda baife, n'abakungu, nga tulayira tuti: “Tukolimirwanga bwe tulobanga okujiira ku Mateeka ga Katonda, ge yatugha ng'abita mu mugheereza we Musa, era ni tuloba okwegenderezanga okukola ng'ebiragiro bya Musengwa Katonda waife n'amateeka ge goonagoona bwe gakoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Titwidha kufumbirwagananga na bamaghanga gandi, nga tughaayo baghala baife okubayira batabane baibwe, oba okutoola baghala baibwe okubayira batabane baife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 34:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 7:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamaghanga agandi abo bwe banaaleetanga eby'okulya oba ebintu ebindi byonabyona okubitunda ku Sabbato, oba ku lunaku olundi olutukuvu, titwidha kubagulangaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.10+EXO.23.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 23:10-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.1+LEV.25.2+LEV.25.3+LEV.25.4+LEV.25.5+LEV.25.6+LEV.25.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 25:1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.1+DEU.15.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 15:1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Buli mwaka ogwomusanvu titwidha kukungulanga bibala bya mu misiri, era twidha kusonighanga abantu amabandha ge tubabandha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Buli mwaka twidha kutoolanga guraamu itaanu edha feeza, kiisi muntu, tudhigheeyo dhikole emirimo mu isinzizo lya Katonda waife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.30.11+EXO.30.12+EXO.30.13+EXO.30.14+EXO.30.15+EXO.30.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 30:11-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era twidha kughangayo ebintu bino: emigaati egigheebwayo eri Katonda, n'ebigheebwayo eby'emere ey'empeke ebya buli lunaku, n'ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa ebya buli lunaku, n'ebigheebwayo ku buli lwa Sabbato, n'ebigheebwayo ku mbaga ey'Ekibinuko eky'Okuboneka kw'Omwezi, n'ebigheebwayo ku mbaga edh'ebibinuko ebindi ebyalagirwa, n'ebintu ebindi ebitukuvu, n'ebigheebwayo ku lw'Abaisiraeli olw'okutoolebwaku ebibi. Twidha kughangayo n'ebintu ebindi byonabyona ebyetaagisa mu isinzizo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ife Abaisiraeli abandi, ni bakabona, n'Abalevi, twidha kukubanga akalulu buli mwaka okubona abanaaleetanga ekigheebwayo eky'enku mu isinzizo lya Katonda waife, olw'okwokya ebigheebwayo ku alutaari ya Musengwa Katonda waife, nga bwe kyaghandiikibwa mu Mateeka. Ekyo twidha kukikolanga nga tujiira ku nda dha baiseife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tweyamye okuleetanga mu isinzizo buli mwaka, ebirime bye tunaasookanga okukungula mu misiri gyaife, n'ebibala bye tunaasookanga okunoga ku miti gyonagyona egy'ebibala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 23:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.26.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 26:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Twidha kutwalanga batabane baife ababeri, ye bakabona mu isinzizo, tubaghengayo eri Musengwa Katonda nga bwe kyaghandiikibwa mu Mateeka. Era twidha kughangayo eri Musengwa Katonda oyo, ente dhaife, n'embuzi, n'entaama, edhinaazaalibwanga mu luzaalo olusooka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Buli mwaka twidha kuleetanga eri bakabona mu isinzizo, engaano ye tunaasookanga okukanda, n'ebintu ebindi, n'omwenge ogw'emizabbibu, n'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva, n'ebibala eby'oku miti egya buli nsambo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.21"
